# results_drl/ sweep output: keep the data and the aggregate figures, ignore
# the regeneratable per-seed renders -- rerun run_experiment.py to recreate
# them. Per-seed *_run.json stays (it carries episode rewards and eval history,
# which the README's learning-behaviour table is computed from) and so do the
# *_policy.pt checkpoints, which are small and which docs/ibm_hardware.md tells
# you to replay on hardware.
results_drl/**/sweep.log
results_drl/**/*_training.png
results_drl/**/*_solved.gif
